{"games":[{"id":14907877970,"name":"[🎄UPD] sushi gambit","desc":"[This game has a copyright free OST]\n(This game is recommended to be played at graphics settings 5 or above.)\n\nSeptember 4th, 1992. You're cursed to run a sushi shop nearing bankruptcy with up to 6 other eternally tortured souls; with the goal of staying in business for 14 days to be freed. Times get tough, so you may need to resort to less ethical food sources…\n\n{inspired by sushi shop simulator}","path":"/game/14907877970-upd-sushi-gambit","slug":"14907877970-upd-sushi-gambit","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6a00fe9d2fcf792e7db89cdaa88739c8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4a891a734102b6ea159854635a8128bb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":11,"visitor":7555805,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-16T09:00:56.807Z","creator":{"name":"Conveyor Crew","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":510411669,"name":"Fantastic Frontier","desc":"Fantastic Frontier's Spring Update [v1.3] arrives! Featuring a huge new island to explore and collect from, with new weapons and armor, 2 new houses, a new task-giver, long requested balance changes and more!\nTo get to the Island purchase the new Boathouse, just south of the Blue Ogre Camp.\n\nCheck the Official groups for the exact balance changes this patch.\n\n----\n\nOfficial Group: www.roblox.com/groups/group.aspx?gid=3352883\n\nFantastic Frontier is an action adventure game where you can fight monsters, fish, gather rare collectibles, hunt birds and more! Loot you find can be used to upgrade your character, buy a home and become a legendary hero! \n\n🐭 If you'd like to support us please like and favorite the game! 🐸","path":"/game/510411669-fantastic-frontier","slug":"510411669-fantastic-frontier","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3022e9059e4b4d7ae1e5507f1837d6b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c3abae374471bb9dc8055549c92dd76d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":11,"visitor":35192576,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-19T11:06:11.095Z","creator":{"name":"Spectrabox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":8426538932,"name":"Elite Zombie Lab","desc":"🧪 Create a cure for the zombies as a scientist! \n🧟‍♀️ Infect scientists as a zombie and escape the facility! \n🔐 Uncover the secrets of the facility! \n\n👍 Like & Favorite for new content, and exclusive outfits!\n\n📋 CHANGELOG \nv. 6.9.12\nAdded NPC Zombies that you can sample and cure\nAdded PlagueDoctor outfit\n\nv. 6.9.7\nAdded Daily Rewards that you can claim to unlock exclusive weapons!\nAdded inventory sorting after equips/re-equips\n\nv. 6.9.5\nAdded a Stats Menu to look at all your stats\nAdded a cool effect when you get coins\nYou now get coins for being sampled or fixing barricades.\nIncreased the amount of coins you get from everything\n\n🏗️ Builder - @Exbium \n📜 Scripter - @Navillion \n\n🔱 Join The Group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/7802405/Studio-Nex","path":"/game/8426538932-elite-zombie-lab","slug":"8426538932-elite-zombie-lab","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dc84dd3c3bd0e54b62c3198b7aae9659/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/49f090a0945036bc342e3e51301a2534/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":11,"visitor":34197758,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-04-06T08:10:46.248Z","creator":{"name":"Studio Nex","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10675066724,"name":"Slime Tower Tycoon [NEW!]","desc":"Welcome to Slime Tower Tycoon! In this game, you'll build an awesome tower full of different slimes & sell their droplets to earn coins! There's no limit to how many slimes you can earn!\r\n\r\n🏰 Build an infinite tower full of cute slimes! (Auto-merges at 175 individual slimes to avoid lag)\r\n\r\n💸 Buy new slimes & upgrade your cauldron to climb the leaderboard!\r\n\r\n✨ Merge slimes into rarer versions that give you extra droplets!\r\n\r\nScripting, Slime Models, UI: Sir_Falstaff\r\nEnvironment Design: TipToesTim\r\n\r\nCreated by one of the developers of OOF Tycoon! ","path":"/game/10675066724-slime-tower-tycoon-new","slug":"10675066724-slime-tower-tycoon-new","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b25db10c5d2881cead221912a15187a4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/2d71d0d97ef30e0a7d1e292d92a92cb9/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":11,"visitor":36283912,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-04-16T15:01:07.681Z","creator":{"name":"Babble Games - Merge Tycoons","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":14433762945,"name":"[NEW] Anime Champions Simulator","desc":"Anime Champions Simulator is an all-new game from the creator of Anime Fighters Simulator.\n\n🌸 Embark on a journey to explore the galaxy!\n🥋 Collect and train formidable anime champions!\n🌀 Travel across a vast galaxy filled with exciting planets!\n🌟 Dive into a world of infinite adventures and possibilities!","path":"/game/14433762945-new-anime-champions-simulator","slug":"14433762945-new-anime-champions-simulator","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9bd9fbdc921121450d9af8b17954ba62/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/no-script.webp","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":11,"visitor":256638664,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-05-11T20:44:45.347Z","creator":{"name":"Bura ACS","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":14,"freeCount":14,"keyCount":10,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8232438881,"name":"Thief Simulator","desc":"CODE: \"50MIL\" = 15K CASH [NEW CODE @ 150K LIKES!]\n\nWELCOME to THIEF SIMULATOR where you will become the RICHEST THIEF in the WORLD!\n\n💰 Sell your loot to get CASH!\n👮 Beat the timers or get sent to JAIL!\n📜 Complete JOBS to UNLOCK better HEISTS!\n💪 Upgrade your SKILLS to become a better THIEF!\n🛠 Use interactive TOOLS, BACKPACKS & BLUEPRINTS to help you in your HEISTS!\n💎 Explore new HOUSES, STORES, BANKS & WORLDS to get better LOOT!\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n💵 Make CASH by robbing NPCs & STEALING LOOT!\n💰 Sell your bag for CASH & UPGRADE them to hold more LOOT!\n🔨 Buy new TOOLS to unlock new ways to STEAL & LOOT!\n🔒 Unlock new HOUSES, STORES, BANKS & WORLDS by purchasing new BLUEPRINTS!\n📈 Try to get to the top of the LEADERBOARDS!\n\nMade by Funwise.","path":"/game/8232438881-thief-simulator","slug":"8232438881-thief-simulator","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8b54844623fd8aef4bf41fee4503a628/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/29c35c691dd91d448507a40f4e3aef4b/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":11,"visitor":72749402,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-29T19:41:47.209Z","creator":{"name":"Funwise","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14476384515,"name":"MY AVATAR SHOP 💸☃️","desc":"💰 Earn coins by selling or buying items ingame to redeem limited UGC!\n👕 \"My Avatar Shop\" is an experience that lets you set up your very own UGC shop! \n🏬Create custom shops to sell UGC\n🎩Showcase your UGC\n💸Make Robux selling your creations\n💬Chat with Friends or make new ones\n\n\n⚠️ Transactions and earnings are generated through the sale of UGC that you have created, and it may take up to a week for your earnings to be credited. The Robux amount displayed in-game corresponds to the price set at the time of sale, but keep in mind that your actual earnings may be reduced due to Roblox taxes. To track your pending Robux, you can check your transaction history here: https://www.roblox.com/transactions\n\n👕 To create a t-shirt to start selling for your tip-jar click here: https://www.roblox.com/develop?View=2","path":"/game/14476384515-my-avatar-shop","slug":"14476384515-my-avatar-shop","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-25804acc0bdee8c86d16b9f8dad4389b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/n